- * draw_primitive() accumulated thirty mgs_* calls while the port was being
- * debugged -- effect logs, alpha-blend experiments, codec-portrait probes, draw
- * skipping switches. Every one of them checks an environment variable that is
- * off in production, but the call and the branch still happen, and brief #28
- * measured about 10 500 draws per second in the open Plant area: roughly 315 000
- * useless calls a second, all of it emulated x86 under Box86.
